OL,3,ASerial rapist police officer passed
OL,4,Avetting despite warnings, BBC reveals
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police officer - who was later
OL,7,Fexposed as a violent serial rapist -
OL,8,Fpassed vetting checks to join the force
OL,9,Fdespite having two reports of criminal
OL,10,Fbehaviour against women on his record,
OL,11,FBBC Disclosure can reveal.
OL,13,FAlan Greer was investigated by police
OL,14,Fin 2002 and 2005 for making
OL,15,Finappropriate phone calls to women,
OL,16,Fwith one case resulting in a formal
OL,17,Fpolice caution.
OL,19,FHe was accepted into Strathclyde Police
OL,20,Fin 2009, despite vetting staff being
OL,21,Faware of his previous offending.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
